    "longDescription": "Scientific Calculator Premium is the best and the most convenient scientific calculator in AppStore. \n\nWhy? \n\nApart from the usual features such as root, power, trigonometric functions, logarithms it also offers: \n- factorial (!) \n- double factorial (!!) \n- drawing graphs \n- four memory blocks \n- inserting constants \n- making notes \n- full history \n- random number generator \n- and many more... \n\nScientific Calculator Premium is made by math/physics students. Our objective is to make it as convenient as traditional calculator, which we used at university. \n\nJust try it, you won't regret it :)",
